    {
      "text": "devil … sheweth him all the kingdoms of the world, Matt. 4:8 (Luke 4:5). desired him that he would shew them a sign, Matt. 16:1. Shew me the tribute money, Matt. 22:19 (Luke 20:24). shall shew great signs and wonders, Matt. 24:24 (Mark 13:22; JS—M 1:22). for a shew make long prayers, Luke 20:47. Father loveth the Son, and sheweth him all things, John 5:20. Philip saith unto him, Lord, shew us the Father, John 14:8. Spirit of truth … will shew you things to come, John 16:13. he shewed himself alive after his passion, Acts 1:3. servants … which shew unto us the way of salvation, Acts 16:17. ye do shew the Lord’s death till he come, 1 Cor. 11:26. shew I unto you a more excellent way, 1 Cor. 12:31. Study to shew thyself approved, 2 Tim. 2:15. shew me thy faith without thy works, James 2:18. shew unto you that eternal life, 1 Jn. 1:2. I will shew thee things which must be, Rev. 4:1. I will shew thee the bride, Rev. 21:9. he shewed me a pure river of water of life, Rev. 22:1.",
